      "id": "https://myjetpack.tumblr.com/post/827020908582617088",
      "url": "https://myjetpack.tumblr.com/post/827020908582617088",
      "title": "My latest books cartoon for The Guardian",
      "content_html": "<img src=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/7033c3b96866a88b628fdc75fc157904/a23b92027e3d081c-f9/s640x960/d39c85214633d795ebd88c8c6bc9390e9a968953.jpg\" data-orig-height=\"823\" data-orig-width=\"1500\" alt=\"Title: Methods for Encouraging a Reluctant Young Reader &#10; &#10;&#10;Panel 1&#10;Caption: Read Together &#10;Image: A small child sits on a sofa, face buried in a book, between two adults doing the same.&#10;&#10;Panel 2&#10;Caption: Bribery&#10;Image: The small child sits on a treasure chest wearing a crown, face buried in a book, in a room full of coins, jewels and precious items.&#10;&#10;Panel 3&#10;Caption: Element of danger&#10;Image: The small child sits, face buried in a book, precariously balanced on a thin branch in a tall tree.&#10;&#10;Panel 4&#10;Caption: Reverse Psychology&#10;Image: The small child sits, face buried in a book, beside a huge bookshelf and a sign that reads &#xE2;&#x80;&#x9C;Adults Only&#xE2;&#x80;&#x9D;&#10;&#10;Panel 5&#10;Caption: Pulleys and Pistons&#10;Image: The small child sits, face buried in a book, amidst a complicated mechanism that provides endless new books.&#10;&#10;Panel 6&#10;Caption: Rituals and Incantations&#10;Image: The small child sits, face buried in a book, in a circle of candles amidst clouds of smoke and mysterious phrases.\" srcset=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/7033c3b96866a88b628fdc75fc157904/a23b92027e3d081c-f9/s75x75_c1/0f6efa6e216f24e8f828ecfcd323c501798ad596.jpg 75w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/7033c3b96866a88b628fdc75fc157904/a23b92027e3d081c-f9/s100x200/fcb21ad3d574fbc4daa293c551b2050447f29f32.jpg 100w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/7033c3b96866a88b628fdc75fc157904/a23b92027e3d081c-f9/s250x400/65872a2ea9915fd8400663992e3353b54f53fb0f.jpg 250w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/7033c3b96866a88b628fdc75fc157904/a23b92027e3d081c-f9/s400x600/c8d26a95b0b110cf7342b749bd20c0a3ae7e5d98.jpg 400w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/7033c3b96866a88b628fdc75fc157904/a23b92027e3d081c-f9/s500x750/7bb9ca6a77